QuestGuidance.Register("en",276,{
[8801]="70059560\n1\tComplete Mission: Locked Down\tYour mission is to destroy the brigand blockade within the mines of Writhenset. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8802]="7006EBE7\n1\tComplete Mission: Looting the Supplies\tYour mission is to travel to the Ekhamâti camp, defeat the dôla, and rob them of their gold in order to supply Mizâdi's forces. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to travel to the Ekhamâti camp, defeat the dôla, and rob them of their gold in order to supply Mizâdi's forces.\n",
[8803]="700581A0\n1\tPick up the Summoning Horn\tUse the summoning horn at the cave entrance to summon Hórin to your side.\n2\tUse the skill Call Hórin and talk to Hórin\tYou should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is missing, and the Call Hórin skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDefeat hobgoblins (total: 10)\030Find the hobgoblin leader\tDefeat hobgoblins in Akûl-lagam with Hórin. If Hórin is missing, and the Call Hórin skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tTalk to Hórin\tA door of unnatural ice blocks your path. You should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is missing, and the Call Hórin skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n5\tDefeat hobgoblin frost-callers (total: 2)\tHórin believes hobgoblin frost-callers are causing the ice to block your path. You should find and defeat the hobgoblin frost-callers. If Hórin is missing, and the Call Hórin skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n6\tDefeat Thrugdar the Slaughterer\tWith the ice door dispelled, you should now be able to progress deeper into Akûl-lagam. You should find and defeat the hobgoblin leader, Thrugdar the Slaughterer. If Hórin is missing, and the Call Hórin skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n7\tTalk to Hórin\tThe hobgoblins have been defeated. You should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is missing, and the Call Hórin skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8804]="700581AB\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have been assigned another important mission! Report to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu to learn the details.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tHórin has announced that he knows what the hobgoblins are planning. You should talk to Hórin in Annâk-khurfu.\n3\tComplete Mission: Loyalty of the Frost-bound\tYour mission is to investigate Akûl-lagam with Hórin. Talk to Hórin to travel to Akûl-lagam.\n4\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Hórin in Annâk-khurfu.\n5\tTalk to Glóin\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[8805]="70057F1B\n1\tComplete Mission: Magic of the Frost-bound\tYour mission is to find and defeat Frost-caller Túgost. Speak to Ausma to travel to Vorkodar.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8806]="70057F21\n1\tDefeat Frost-caller Túgost\tFind and defeat Frost-caller Túgost. He can be found in Vorkodar.\n",
[8807]="70066B4E\n1\tTalk to The Captain\tI looked my friend over and asked if they could continue....\n2\tDefeat the Corsair crew ([see journal]/16)\tWe scoured the beach, slaughtering with impunity. None could withstand our vengeance or our blades....\n3\tFind Yarikh\030Defeat Akhât\tAt last, Yarikh came into view. Two of his lieutenants flanked him near a serviceable launch they were trying to get into the sea. We wasted no time to engage.\n4\tMake your way to your friend's side\tYarikh's boat slipped out of sight as my blade wet itself on Akhât's corpse. Behind me, I heard a gasp and sputter for air... my friend.\n",
[8808]="70062FB8\n1\tDefeat the wolf-matron\030Defeat wolves (total: 15)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8809]="7006302D\n1\tComplete the Mission: Mother of Wolves\tWhat may be an error in judgement has raised the ire of a pack of nearby wolves with only one pack-leader now in charge. Speak with the mission giver to make your way to the ruins to finish the work of hunters.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tWith both the pack-leaders now eliminated, the wolves should be quieter for a time whilst they fight amongst themselves to determine their new order. Return to the mission giver and tell them you succeeded.\n",
[8810]="70066B5B\n1\tSpeak with the captain\tWe sat in a simple study, each enjoying a smoke and spoke at length about our goals....\n2\tSmoke with the captain\tOften he would be like this, jovial and open, a warm companion. I listened quietly and drew on my pipe....\n3\tSpeak with the captain\tWhen it was my turn to speak he listened intently and responded....\n",
[8811]="7006EC06\n1\tComplete Mission: Natural Prey\tYour mission is to travel to Tir Katar and put an end to the caracals who have been preying on nearby travellers and help any survivors you can find. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYou have successfully put an end to the caracals in Tir Katar as well as rescued any survivors! Return with the scout to Setokúli with this report.\n",
[8812]="70058C70\n1\tComplete Mission: Nests of Ice\tYour mission is to clear out the cold-worm nesting grounds at the ruins of Stormwall. Speak to Hórin to travel to Stormwall.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8813]="70058C7B\n1\tDestroy cold-worm nests (total: 8)\tDestroy cold-worm nests.\n",
[8814]="70070CC5\n1\tComplete Mission: New Hides to Tan\tYour mission is to travel to the west of Sul Madásh to the Lair of the Shadlúgai and gather crocodile hides. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYour mission is to travel to the west of Sul Madásh to the Lair of the Shadlúgai and gather crocodile hides.\n",
[8815]="70062FC4\n1\tDefeat the brigand-captain\030Defeat brigand lieutenants (total: 2)\030Defeat brigands (total: 15)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8816]="70063035\n1\tComplete the Mission: Not as Many Heads\tA change in leadership could throw the Southron Men in the area into disarray. The mission giver at Lhan Garan will have a scout lead you to the camp to remove the leadership.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tThe leaders of the brigands are defeated. You should now return to the mission giver in Lhan Garan and tell them of your victory.\n",
[8817]="70070CFB\n1\tComplete Mission: Oh, Rats\tYour mission is to rid Sul Madásh of its rat problem. They are growing in numbers and becoming a problem for the settlement. The rats must be stopped and their nests destroyed. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully pushed the rats out of Sul Madásh and destroyed their nests. That should stop them from overrunning the settlement for now.\n",
[8818]="7006C538\n1\tComplete Mission: Orders from the Highest\tYour mission is to travel to Ab-dâna and eliminate Orcs you find there to recover any orders they have so that Ashâmi can discover who is sending them. Speak to Ashâmi to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ashâmi\tYou have successfully eliminated Orcs within Ab-dâna and recovered the orders they have been receiving. Return with the scout to Ashâmi with this report.\n",
[8819]="700580E2\n1\tMine valuable ore (total: 10)\tFind and collect valuable ore inside Sundergrót.\n",
[8820]="700580E3\n1\tComplete Mission: Ore Overflowing\tYour mission is to retrieve ore from Sundergrót. Speak to Hórin to travel to Sundergrót,\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8821]="7006D1AA\n1\tComplete Mission: Outlaws in Iridír\tYour mission is to help the Dumûri defend Iridír from pillaging brigands. Raise the control point banner when each area has been cleared of attackers. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to defend Iridír.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have helped the Dumûri defend Iridír from pillaging brigands! Return with Khâdamul to discuss your success.\n",
[8822]="70062FB1\n1\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n2\tFind and speak with a scout\t\n",
[8823]="7006302F\n1\tComplete the Mission: Patrol the Township\tThe request is a simple one: patrol through the pathways that make up the township of Clegur at night. Speak with the mission giver to assist.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tYour patrol was not as uneventful as everyone presumed. It appears that the Men from the south are intent on invading every corner of Swanfleet if they can. Alert the mission giver.\n",
[8824]="7006C52C\n1\tComplete Mission: Perversion of Nature\tYour mission is to travel to the Gorge of Woe and defeat the hive-matron and her corrupted Urâshi wasps before they can spread throughout Urash Dâr. Speak with Raphûz to travel.\n2\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou have successfully slain the hive-matron and prevented the corrupted wasps from spreading in Urash Dâr! Return with the scout to Raphûz with this report.\n",
[8825]="70069076\n1\tComplete Mission: Protecting the Sea Lanes\tYour mission is to protect the merchant ship Khâlbina on its trip to Jax Phanâl. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have successfully defeated the Corsairs! Return with the Umbari scout to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8826]="70070D01\n1\tComplete Mission: Prowling Scavengers\tYour mission is to travel to Pits of Chortáth in the south-west and help the scouts of Sâr Marsag make the paths safer to travel by thinning the pack of jackals in the area. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully thinned the number of jackals in the Pits of Chortáth and helped the scouts of Sâr Marsag.\n",
[8827]="70070CCC\n1\tComplete Mission: Questionable Morels\tThe gardeners of Sul Madásh have asked for assistance in gathering mushrooms in the nearby bog that are untainted by the Pale Blight, so that they can grow them safely within the settlement. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully gathered unblighted mushrooms from the bog outside of Sul Madásh. Bring them to the gardeners so they can begin growing more.\n",
[8828]="7005CC80\n1\tCollect ice (total: 8)\tCollect ice clusters created by luring frost grims to highlighted areas.\n",
[8829]="7005CCB3\n1\tComplete Mission: Raging Frost\tYour mission is to have frost grims super-freeze ice, collect it, and retrieve it. Speak to Horin to travel to Kallamdâm.\n2\tTalk to Horin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Horin for your reward!\n",
[8830]="700585A4\n1\tPush back raiders to the western gate of Skarháld\tPush back raiders to the western gate of Skarháld.\n2\tDefend Skarháld from the Gundabad raiding party\tDefend Skarháld from the Gundabad raiding party.\n",
[8831]="700585BD\n1\tComplete Mission: Raiders From Gundabad\tYour mission is to defend the fortress of Skarháld from a Gundabad raiding party. Speak to Hórin to travel to Skarháld.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8832]="70058C76\n1\tComplete Mission: Reclaiming the Torrent-spires\tYour mission is to reclaim the dwarf-ruins of Zarkul-sulûn. Speak to Ausma to travel to Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
